# Freeze values for F33 (2026-11-24). PREV_* are the F23 records, the same as F24.env to F32.env.
# F24 (main de2a3cfd): not qualified (G1 UNKNOWN, provider subscription inactive: OpenCode Go HTTP 403), ids spent.
# F25 (main 2fa3e008): guest half passed (G1, rp, dr, routes 4/4, EVQ 21/22); not qualified because corpus mode refused the
# pre-D50 pilot budgets (fixed by PR #138); ids spent. The guest was restored to the pre-F25-2026-11-13 checkpoint (= F23 installed),
# F26 (main 2780072a): verified 2026-11-13, EVQ 22/22; its rehearsal wedged at unit 90, cap defect fixed in #147/#153-#158; ids spent.
# F27 (main db078536): not qualified: rp model refusal; G1 passed; ids spent (its dr id route-probe-dr-2026-11-15a never reached the guest).
# F28 (main 40e651b1): verified 2026-11-15, EVQ 22/22, routes 4/4; ids spent (G1, rp and its dr id route-probe-dr-2026-11-15b).
# F29 (main 28f407b8): verified 2026-11-17, EVQ 22/22, routes 4/4; ids spent (G1, rp and its dr id route-probe-dr-2026-11-16a).
# F30 (main 5626e34f): verified 2026-11-18, EVQ 22/22, routes 4/4; ids spent (G1, rp and its dr id route-probe-dr-2026-11-18a).
# F31 (main cc1de6df): verified 2026-11-20 (two guest chains), EVQ 22/22, routes 4/4; proving round 1a found the no-reap/v1 stall (fixed in #251);
# rounds 1b and 3 ran on F31 chain 2; ids spent (G1, rp and its dr id route-probe-dr-2026-11-20a).
# F32 (main 08f3c3ee): verified 2026-11-21, EVQ 22/22, routes 4/4, proving rounds (evidence/F32); ids spent (G1, rp and its dr id route-probe-dr-2026-11-21a).
# F33 replaces F32 as the final freeze, the F-H1 candidate (owner 2026-11-23, thesis D59): V left the thesis (D58 amendment), the research cap is US$10,
# and B-only screening of the compliant tasks is added; F33 = dev with #238 and #240 (owner option A) and the approved scope.
# The guest is restored to the pre-F31-2026-11-20 checkpoint again (= F23 installed with the H1 hold, taken before any F31 guest write),
# so F23 (main 13ed1193) is the installed and qualified previous freeze.
# Rules kept from the kit: no BOM, LF only, no quotes or trailing comment on FREEZE / FREEZE_COMMIT / GUEST_IP
# (freeze-guard.sh reads FREEZE and FREEZE_COMMIT with sed; the mk-svc-config.py and mk-dr-config.py scripts split each non-comment line on "=").
# All comments are on their own lines.
#
# STATUS 2026-11-24: commit chosen (owner-authorized dev-to-main merge, PR #288, tree 07c56d6e identical to dev 9206c2e1 and to the
# g33b gate tree); admission ids committed (PR #279); the (13ed1193, F33) measurer pair lands in this kit commit before 05.
# Every PREV_* value below was read from evidence/F23/logs, then read again on the cited line (the cited line contains the value),
# and compared with the record of the same name under /home/tbound/tbound-h/f23 (all equal, 2026-11-13). Re-checked for F25 to F32 on every cited line (24 of 24).

